<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:57Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>No mention of fossil fuels in latest COP31 draft deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:410e4175c6af8b72b03d353548e16c225eb62152af2772796856a68e57128c2a</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T16:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/no-mention-of-fossil-fuels-in-latest-cop31-draft-deal/a-79992394--36cfb19df8f5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/no-mention-of-fossil-fuels-in-latest-cop31-draft-deal/a-79992394?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">One of the most fraught debates at the UN climate talks in Turkey has revolved around the future of coal, oil and gas. Now, all mention of fossil fuels has been removed from the summit's new draft agreement.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Anthropic trading tests investors' appetite for AI</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:de34f80f8d66f34fa8992a1e795f12b81a7fbeabfa9b5f786da0a5bea2af2aed</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T15:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/anthropic-trading-tests-investors-appetite-for-ai/a-79993163--d18c2700770b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/anthropic-trading-tests-investors-appetite-for-ai/a-79993163?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Shares in Anthropic have started trading on the Nasdaq after its record $81 billion IPO. Its performance will put investor confidence in AI and the Claude maker's $1.5 trillion valuation to the test.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Alexander Zverev faces fresh lawsuit from ex-girlfriend</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1b5f8346c66c31580d91ad16ce8ab8722dfd8b846aba084aa27b3fe63aaf638f</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:23Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T15:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/alexander-zverev-faces-fresh-lawsuit-from-ex-girlfriend/a-79990005--d63dbeaa4aae.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/alexander-zverev-faces-fresh-lawsuit-from-ex-girlfriend/a-79990005?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">World No. 1 tennis player Alexander Zverev is facing a new lawsuit related to a domestic abuse trial. The lawyer for his ex-girlfriend, Brenda Patea, told DW what the allegations are against the German player.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>EU Commission confirms it was targeted in cyberattack using AI tools</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a894031ed93bdb729d76d9f575f8e1c931d4459dba477b5b35752d2978f82ec8</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:26Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T14:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-commission-confirms-it-was-targeted-in-cyberattack-using-ai-tools/a-79993016--2e1cd85b257c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-commission-confirms-it-was-targeted-in-cyberattack-using-ai-tools/a-79993016?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The European Commission was targeted by an "AI-generated cybercampaign," a spokesperson has said. This is the first time the bloc has publicly reported an AI-based cyberattack.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Wadephul: 'Coalition of the Willing' talks in Berlin send strong signal to Moscow</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:263ad0310f4766e9aa8cc15b256591e1e2c6e5c7934472af36a702590e50fae7</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T13:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wadephul-coalition-of-the-willing-talks-in-berlin-send-strong-signal-to-moscow/a-79990664--ce1ce93ebd6c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wadephul-coalition-of-the-willing-talks-in-berlin-send-strong-signal-to-moscow/a-79990664?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">German Foreign Minister Wadephul has said the Coalition of the Willing meeting in Berlin sends a clear message to Moscow to take peace talks seriously. He also warned Ukraine should be prepared for peace talks to fail.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Pakistan minister to visit India, but no breakthrough expected</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:85af3a46fd1583d2c47e6c6c9646df84fef21786fcaebbce976bb46df62d47f0</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:32Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T13:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pakistan-minister-to-visit-india-but-no-breakthrough-expected/a-79991717--07503556e8b2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pakistan-minister-to-visit-india-but-no-breakthrough-expected/a-79991717?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Pakistani minister's visit to India for a Shanghai Cooperation Organization forum marks a rare high-level contact between the two archrivals, but analysts say it does not signal a resumption of bilateral engagement.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>APEC summit: Trump, Xi, Putin talks end with 'peace declaration'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:40b64cb8385e9d954352dbf274d80b53f21587be6cba7b1976769ce01cfe6ebb</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:35Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T13:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/apec-summit-trump-xi-putin-talks-end-with-peace-declaration/live-79964719--35792a5d6dfa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/apec-summit-trump-xi-putin-talks-end-with-peace-declaration/live-79964719?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The three world leaders discussed the Russian invasion of Ukraine as well as nuclear arms controls. Following the trilateral talks, President Trump reportedly headed to the airport. Follow DW live.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Myanmar committed genocide against Rohingya, top UN court rules</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5e3aca477c2b08e51dbe5328adbc52103dade3acacf5568485aac7e837ebf5b9</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T11:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya-top-un-court-rules/a-79987898--1622af9cbda3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya-top-un-court-rules/a-79987898?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The International Court of Justice has upheld large parts of a genocide case against Myanmar linked to the 2017 conflict with its Rohingya minority. It called for it to pay reparations and let refugees return safely.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Pistorius to visit Auschwitz memorial in Poland trip</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6562dd7a7c1d63b518d4707774a4c8c256cb4b3f4016c47403c65aefd0cbf819</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:41Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T11:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-pistorius-to-visit-auschwitz-memorial-in-poland-trip/live-79987991--a60c55195cbb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-pistorius-to-visit-auschwitz-memorial-in-poland-trip/live-79987991?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's Defense Minister's first stop in Poland will be at the memorial site of the former Nazi extermination camp Auschwitz-Birkenau. Follow DW for more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Denmark ratifies security deal with US and Greenland</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a04087cfb16bd4d63d0d3b3ec5ad441a01e44bdbcbe15dc4542df1ad57d000f2</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T10:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/denmark-ratifies-security-deal-with-us-and-greenland/a-79988989--97c7c7d282a7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/denmark-ratifies-security-deal-with-us-and-greenland/a-79988989?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The deal provides the US with expanded military access, on top of what it already had based on a previous agreement. It comes after threats by US President Trump to take Greenland with force.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>South Korea's top court overturns jail term for former PM Han</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ac5ad0aa0e8b8533403ce24c255ad8302625b7a8a6c8d8a62990868452dc5c05</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T09:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-korea-s-top-court-overturns-jail-term-for-former-pm-han/a-79987912--678e658dc4df.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-korea-s-top-court-overturns-jail-term-for-former-pm-han/a-79987912?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Former Prime Minister Han Duck-so was convicted of helping legitimize the 2024 martial law declaration. The case will now return to a lower court.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran balances ties with China and Russia as Trump ramps up pressure</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:69c70572a39b224533315f3faf5ba3e87532e931b0ba6a05e98624b72dba346d</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:51Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T09:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-balances-ties-with-china-and-russia-as-trump-ramps-up-pressure/a-79979920--3c92417b16df.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-balances-ties-with-china-and-russia-as-trump-ramps-up-pressure/a-79979920?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Donald Trump seeks to tighten economic pressure on Iran, China remains its biggest oil customer and Russia a key partner. But both powers are balancing support for Tehran against broader interests with Washington.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>India: Nearly 50,000 evacuated as Cyclone Akvan nears the coast</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2688a7a10a09bd341d00912f90a1b66c7beb14b6f7cc547c04d6fefffdae5d7c</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:53Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T08:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-nearly-50-000-evacuated-as-cyclone-akvan-nears-the-coast/live-79987334--51fef60fd516.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-nearly-50-000-evacuated-as-cyclone-akvan-nears-the-coast/live-79987334?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Cyclone Akvan, the third severe storm to hit India's east coast in a month, is expected to make landfall on November 20. Meanwhile, PM Modi led a meeting of his Council of Ministers.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What makes 'Grand Theft Auto VI' more than just a game?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:39496e37f5600f0cc33dd37065e56302ca01b4bef22b3f35545a110583e926e1</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:28:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T07:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-makes-grand-theft-auto-vi-more-than-just-a-game/a-79965822--24b2767125c4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-makes-grand-theft-auto-vi-more-than-just-a-game/a-79965822?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">When "GTA VI" is released on November 19, millions of people worldwide will rush to their consoles to play it. How has this video game created such a cross-generational buzz?</summary><category term="Technology" /></entry><entry><title>Is the AI bubble bursting just as Anthropic goes public?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:64ea71601b741faa16f123988b9f2f832d61576b44a609a94a7962a7cfb90ad1</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:28:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T05:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/is-the-ai-bubble-bursting-just-as-anthropic-goes-public/a-79896537--10f78cdc2264.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/is-the-ai-bubble-bursting-just-as-anthropic-goes-public/a-79896537?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The sharp sell-off in tech stocks after the US midterms and the Nvidia scandal has cast doubt on Anthropic's IPO. Yet with hundreds of billions still being invested, some think the AI party is still in full swing.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Crimean Bridge has been attacked again, Russian official says</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:be4f349917eef799c013e6fb719e549e6bc6bf350eb30fb11a6aefb7721c30ba</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:28:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T03:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/crimean-bridge-has-been-attacked-again-russian-official-says/a-79986700--99815dc85f47.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/crimean-bridge-has-been-attacked-again-russian-official-says/a-79986700?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Crimean Bridge has been attacked again, Crimea's Russian-installed governor said. The attack comes as Vladimir Putin prepares to sit down with Donald Trump and Xi Jinping for joint talks in China.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine's allies attend 'Coalition of the Willing' summit in Berlin</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8de1bf02664982654f203d7774cfd67d16fe95d18fe77b0f49092b4d06a4ccf9</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:29:57Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T02:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-s-allies-attend-coalition-of-the-willing-summit-in-berlin/live-79986520--875753e4670a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-s-allies-attend-coalition-of-the-willing-summit-in-berlin/live-79986520?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ukraine's European backers are convening in Berlin, with US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner also set to attend the meeting. Follow the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Almost 1 in 4 children live in conflict zones — report</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0eeaf4ad570c9f76a9193bee72d000fb13fd3d1fdd864a124917dfe1369ce324</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:28:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T00:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/almost-1-in-4-children-live-in-conflict-zones-report/a-79979203--07598193af0c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/almost-1-in-4-children-live-in-conflict-zones-report/a-79979203?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Denial of humanitarian access, abductions and sexual violence are among several violations against children that have increased dramtically over the past year, according to a new report by Save the Children.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Grand Theft Auto VI launches to global fanfare</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:94fc2ec19ac88a1843e0c437257a9fc95bca8813e0e058f0ca90b07ba3670fd1</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:28:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T23:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/grand-theft-auto-vi-launches-to-global-fanfare/a-79986461--a4bcdbd4f395.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/grand-theft-auto-vi-launches-to-global-fanfare/a-79986461?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After 13 years of waiting, fans around the world will get to play the latest installment in the blockbuster video game series. In focus: A tale of crime and violence in a fictionalized version of Miami.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What the Crimean bridge attack means for Russia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8a1a042734d153495282d47cecdf55b88ab4d85d59e46461e8284302e0d65a03</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:28:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T20:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-the-crimean-bridge-attack-means-for-russia/a-79985991--1ee630640446.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-the-crimean-bridge-attack-means-for-russia/a-79985991?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ukraine's latest strike on the Kerch Bridge has disrupted a key transport link between Russia and Crimea. Beyond the damage, the attack could have serious consequences for Russian military logistics and Putin's prestige.</summary><category term="NRS-Import" /></entry><entry><title>US Pentagon chief Hegseth signs military deal in Venezuela</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:89a81eb4ba997578e413dfafa05640100dd488bee0211edd6ae2c41ec397b2f0</id><updated>2026-11-19T17:28:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T20:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-pentagon-chief-hegseth-signs-military-deal-in-venezuela/a-79985607--34c2cd46bf99.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-pentagon-chief-hegseth-signs-military-deal-in-venezuela/a-79985607?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">On a visit to Caracas, Pete Hegseth signed a deal that signifies the "reestablishment of our defense partnership." US-Venezuela ties were strained for years until US troops ousted ex-President Nicolas Maduro in January.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
